<title>NIGERIA: Nigerian Guaranty Trust Bank 1996 profit up.</title>
<headline>Nigerian Guaranty Trust Bank 1996 profit up.</headline>
<dateline>LAGOS 1997-06-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996</p>
<p>			    (In million naira unless stated).</p>
<p>				     1997	   1996</p>
<p> Gross earnings		   2,600    vs 2,100</p>
<p> Profit before taxation	 1,030    vs 1,010  Taxation			     236.8  vs 233.7</p>
<p> Profit after taxation	    794    vs 776.2</p>
<p>Dividend - 50 kobo per share vs 1.71 Scrip - Three new shares for every two is proposed. Full name is Guaranty Trust Bank Plc.</p>
<p>($1=85 naira)</p>
